The installer asks where the aircraft live, and puts the bridge page there

One more line on the install screen: the Community folder, prefilled with whatever Tandem finds
on this machine, with a Find it button when it guesses wrong. Say yes and the bridge page goes
in there as its own folder, marked as ours; uninstall takes that folder out and nothing else.
The same on the command line, for an unattended run: --community, --no-bridge.

It was tested into a temporary folder, not your real one, and D:\MSFS\Community still holds the
same 134 things it did before.
